{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sulo the Sidekick\u00a0</strong>is a playful desktop companion that lives right on your desktop. Pick a career for Sulo. He works while you do your thing and rests when you do. Remember to take care of well-being \u2014 yours too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561780/extras/838bf042311a8d6ef1cee527211fea9f.poster.avif?t=1748370933\" width=800 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561780/extras/838bf042311a8d6ef1cee527211fea9f.webm?t=1748370933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561780/extras/838bf042311a8d6ef1cee527211fea9f.mp4?t=1748370933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Screen Time Tracker</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand your habits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track daily breaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promotes balance &amp; focus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wellness Through Items</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Sulo's earnings to buy items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item helps reduce stress buildup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn benefits through friendly tooltips</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561780?t=1748370933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561780?t=1748370933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561780/614f3132948f9cc68b21623346da2e4d6e79b66b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748370933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akam